rtant; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"4\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBwEZyK7pp7GYibA2ibnMkWXVnXRtmdIdBFj5oVY4AzjS3uqaXlobDyoTiaWwySzQGFvMeOPDcPcqJSvj7HXR9gevbLGsjsfKTaMvg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=1\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"1\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(40, 40, 40, 0.88); line-height: 2; letter-spacing: 1px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"text-indent: 2.1333em; white-space: normal; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">2026年5月15日上午，2026 第十三届花椒餐博大会在沈阳新世界博览馆盛大启幕，大会汇聚全国餐饮行业精英、品牌创始人等共探餐饮产业升级新路径、共话行业发展新未来。马俊龙律师作为花椒餐博大会法律顾问及专家导师，受邀出席本次行业盛会，亮相中国餐饮组织发展研修院成立仪式核心环节，与行业大咖共同见证这一重要时刻。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center; justify-content: center; display: flex; flex-flow: row; margin: 10px 0px 40px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block; width: auto; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(139, 2, 1); min-width: 10%; max-width: 100%; flex: 0 0 auto; height: auto; align-self: flex-start; padding: 9px 20px; box-shadow: rgb(245, 225, 170) 6px 6px 0px 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"margin: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(139, 2, 1) 0px 0px 4px; line-height: 1.3; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"visibility: visible;\">#研修院成立 &nbsp;赋能行业升级#</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;justify-content: center;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 30px 0px 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: auto;min-width: 5%;max-width: 100%;flex: 0 0 auto;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: flex;width: 100%;flex-flow: column;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"z-index: 1;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 0px;height: 0px;vertical-align: top;overflow: hidden;border-style: solid;border-width: 14px;border-color: rgb(139, 2, 1) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) rgb(139, 2, 1);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"display: inline-block;vertical-align: top;width: 95%;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;padding: 21px 27px;height: auto;margin: 0px 0px 0px -29px;background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);border-style: solid;border-width: 1px;border-color: rgb(163, 0, 5);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgba(40, 40, 40, 0.88);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大会首日，中国餐饮组织发展研修院正式揭牌成立，成为本届花椒餐博大会的核心亮点之一。研修院致力于打造餐饮行业专业化、体系化的学习与交流平台，为餐饮连锁品牌规模化发展提供支撑与保障。成立仪式现场大咖云集，行业重磅嘉宾齐聚一堂，共同见证研修院诞生，共绘餐饮行业专业化发展蓝图。</span></p></section><section style=\"margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBxybkxtjxj0Qib1ZJuvVTjobYzkqiak22wNsUPkhKtVKse7Ivx3CSPk52VYdbG9zdGBLLVLoTbmeNiaiaA99Ha15Ahw2HicMUO21p50/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=2\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.5) / 1; width: 587px !important; height: auto !important;\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXBxybkxtjxj0Qib1ZJuvVTjobYzkqiak22wNsUPkhKtVKse7Ivx3CSPk52VYdbG9zdGBLLVLoTbmeNiaiaA99Ha15Ahw2HicMUO21p50/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\" data-cropselx2=\"493\" data-cropsely2=\"278\" data-imgfileid=\"100001250\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 20px 0px 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: justify;font-size: 14px;color: rgba(40, 40, 40, 0.88);letter-spacing: 1px;line-height: 2;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;text-align: justify;\"><span leaf=\"\">北京盈科（沈阳）律师事务所、博望餐饮法务团队作为花椒餐博大会的法律顾问，</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">马俊龙律师</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">作为花椒学社</span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">「法务风控专家、连锁股权合伙专家」</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">已连续受邀出席花椒大会7年。马律师长期聚焦连锁企业法律服务领域，在股权顶层设计、股权合伙模式搭建、连锁企业合规管理、商业特许经营（连锁加盟）法务、投融资并购、知识产权、法务风险防控体系建设等方面拥有丰富经验与深厚积淀。此次受邀出席研修院成立仪式并上台参与核心环节，既是行业对其专业能力的高度认可，也是法律专业力量深度赋能餐饮行业发展的重要体现。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 95%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KAOThu2SXByLOPT3hVQId9Miaia1Nl6SgAVW4k6dyGFic5zy8XIs5LXtTZHtzj8icyR4ib8wct6R5qrEGLk9HDKX7KrQuN56zHfs4n5LnSYKGQ5c/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.7138888888888889\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; aspect-ratio: calc(1.40078) / 1; width: 643px !important; height: auto !important;\" width=\"100%\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"6\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3C%3Fxml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'%3F%3E%3Csvg width='1px' height='1px' viewBox='0 0 1 1' version='1.1' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' xmlns:xlink='http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink'%3E%3Ctitle%3E%3C/title%3E%3Cg stroke='none' stroke-width='1' fill='none' fill-rule='evenodd' fill-opacity='0'%3E%3Cg transform='translate(-249.000000, -126.000000)' fill='%23FFFFFF'%3E%3Crect x='249' y='126' width='1' height='1'%3E%3C/rect%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/g%3E%3C/svg%3E\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\"></section></section><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></p><section style=\"